                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "898845cd-f684-3a3d-bb25-f4d7d4affdb2",
                        "entry_id": "2e56e4e8-4b15-3ac5-8fc8-f5eea1368b32",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An Atari video game system or computer, such as the Atari 2600 or Atari ST."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2ffeb48-3e10-4c25-ae22-925b9b706d66",
                                "sense_id": "898845cd-f684-3a3d-bb25-f4d7d4affdb2",
                                "text": "Asked what they liked best about visiting their father, both named playing his Atari game. \"What if he didn't have an Atari, would you still go visit him?\" Dr. Davis asked."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ae42f08-ebcd-4b5b-b6fc-f7e774a65f95",
                                "sense_id": "898845cd-f684-3a3d-bb25-f4d7d4affdb2",
                                "text": "Even my husband, when he takes a break from playin' his Atari on the TV, makes comments about how weird the livin' room looks without the rain lamp."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed025150-88bc-48ef-9c78-e11da9c388e6",
                                "sense_id": "898845cd-f684-3a3d-bb25-f4d7d4affdb2",
                                "text": "Whatever the reason, you've found yourself wanting an Atari once again. Yes, the very first video game company did produce many different consoles, but when I say \"an Atari\" you know what I'm talking about: the Video Computer System, a.k.a. the VCS, a.k.a. the 2600, a.k.a. the Atari."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
